---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Rent Collection Tracker" description="Automated rent tracking with late fee calculations, arrears register, and dashboard KPIs. Available in 3 tiers.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/products/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Products</a>

      <h1>Rent Collection Tracker</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Automated rent tracking with late fee calculations, arrears register, and dashboard KPIs. Track payments, outstanding balances, and tenant history across unlimited properties and units.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What's Included</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Automated Excel Workbooks:</strong> 7 sheets with formulas, dashboards, and auto-calculations</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Register:</strong> Track rent received, outstanding balances, and late fees</li>
          <li><strong>Arrears Dashboard:</strong> KPI summary showing total arrears, number of defaulters, and collection rate</li>
          <li><strong>Late Fee Calculator:</strong> Automatic calculations based on Act 220 and L.I. 369 regulations</li>
          <li><strong>Tenant History:</strong> Payment performance analysis and trends</li>
          <li><strong>PDF Guide:</strong> Instructions for property managers and landlords</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp Cards:</strong> 5 marketing cards for social media (Portfolio tier only)</li>
          <li><strong>Offline-first:</strong> Works in Excel or Google Sheets. No cloud, no subscriptions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0;">
        <h2>Choose Your Tier</h2>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Landlord</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Perfect for single property owners tracking up to 10 rental units.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 49</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Up to 10 units</li>
              <li>Excel workbook (7 sheets)</li>
              <li>Payment register</li>
              <li>Late fee calculator</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/t18i981du5" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Manager</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">For property managers handling unlimited tenants and properties.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 99</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Unlimited units</li>
              <li>Unlimited properties</li>
              <li>Full Excel suite</li>
              <li>PDF guide</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/g2x1377cmx" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Portfolio</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Complete suite with all features and WhatsApp marketing materials.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 179</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Unlimited units & properties</li>
              <li>Full Excel suite + templates</li>
              <li>PDF guide</li>
              <li>5 WhatsApp cards</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/8873100u71" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h3>Key Features</h3>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>Dashboard KPIs: Total rent due, outstanding balance, collection rate, number of defaulters</li>
          <li>Automated late fee calculations per Act 220 and L.I. 369</li>
          <li>Tenant-by-tenant payment history and trends</li>
          <li>Monthly and annual summaries</li>
          <li>Color-coded alerts for overdue payments</li>
          <li>Export to PDF for tenant correspondence</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <p style="margin:0;"><strong>Act 220 & L.I. 369 Compliant:</strong> All calculations and late fee structures comply with Ghana's Rent Act, 1963 and related regulations.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/contact/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Have Questions? Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
